  </style><style>blockquote,h1,h2,h3,img,li,ol,p,ul{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0}@media only screen and (max-width:425px){.tab-row-full{width:100%!important}.tab-col-full{display:block!important;width:100%!important}.tab-pad{padding:0!important}}</style></head><body style="background-color:#f3f3f0"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><!--body--><table border="0" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" align="center"><tbody><tr><td style="margin:0px;background-color:#f3f3f0;padding-top:32px;padding-right:12px;padding-bottom:32px;padding-left:12px"><div style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0" data-skip-in-text="true">在此之前你仍可使用 Pro，以下是之后的变化。<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:560px;width:100%;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;border-style:solid;background-color:#ffffff;min-width:300px;padding-top:28px;padding-right:28px;padding-bottom:28px;padding-left:28px;border-radius:14px;border-width:1px;border-color:#e3e3de"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><h3 style="margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#222222;font-size:24px;line-height:38px;font-weight:600">你的 Pro 计划将于 <!-- -->{{.EndsOn}}<!-- --> 结束</h3><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#3a3a37;margin:0 0 20px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0">你已取消 Capy Notebook Pro。在 <!-- -->{{.EndsOn}}<!-- --> 之前，你仍可使用 Pro 的全部功能，之后账户将转为免费计划。</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td align="left" data-id="__react-email-column" style="border-color:#f0e0bd;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;background-color:#fdf5e4;border-radius:10px;padding-top:14px;padding-right:16px;padding-bottom:14px;padding-left:16px"><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#3a3a37;margin:0 0 20px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0"><strong>{{.EndsOn}}</strong><strong> 起的变化</strong></p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:100%;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><ul style="padding-left:26px;list-style-type:disc"><li style="margin-bottom:8px;margin-top:8px;padding-left:6px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale"><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#3a3a37;margin:0 0 0px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0">存储额度降为 100 MB，你目前已使用 <strong>{{.StorageUsed}}</strong>。</p></li><li style="margin-bottom:8px;margin-top:8px;padding-left:6px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale"><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#3a3a37;margin:0 0 0px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0">AI 额度降为每月 1,000。</p></li><li style="margin-bottom:8px;margin-top:8px;padding-left:6px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale"><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#3a3a37;margin:0 0 0px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0">单个文件上限降为 10 MB。</p></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#3a3a37;margin:0 0 20px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0">如果届时文件仍超过 100 MB，你将有 14 天释放空间，之后账户将变为只读。</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:100%;text-align:left;margin-bottom:20px"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><a href="{{.OpenURL}}" style="line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;color:#ffffff;background-color:#222222;border-color:#222222;border-width:2px;border-style:solid;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;border-radius:6px;padding:12px 20px 12px 20px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:20px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:500%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">管理订阅</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:500%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:32px"/><p style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:19px;color:#6e6e68;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:left;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale">你收到这封邮件是因为你取消了 Capy Notebook Pro。</p><p style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:19px;color:#6e6e68;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:left;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale"><a href="{{.UnsubscribeURL}}" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#5a4bc2;text-decoration-line:none;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">不再接收账单邮件</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>
